#
#   fetching_5 - Fetch::Fetching: HTTP fetch and HTTP-redirect fetch
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of Libraries/LibWeb/Fetch/Fetching/Fetching.cpp (lines 1195-1557): HTTP fetch
#       (service workers: FIXMEs as in C++; the CORS-preflight fetch when one is needed, then
#       HTTP-network-or-cache fetch; the CORS and TAO checks; redirects by redirect mode) and
#       HTTP-redirect fetch. Each C++ lambda is a capture struct with a static function
#       (DESIGN.md §2.7).
